        <p class="preview-note"><strong>Preview:</strong> crate line-up and exact rewards are being finalised. The reward lists below show the kinds of loot each crate tier can drop — check in-game and on <a href="${DISCORD_INVITE}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Discord</a> for the current crates.</p>
